    "title": "Illinois women's tennis adds home matches against Kansas City and Bradley - Chambana Sun",
    "text": "The University of Illinois Fighting Illini women’s tennis team has added two home matches to its schedule. The team will host Kansas City on March 2 at 9 a.m. CT and Bradley on March 11 at 4 p.m. Both matches will take place in Champaign, Illinois.\nThe Fighting Illini women’s tennis program competes in NCAA Division I and is part of the Big Ten Conference as one of the University of Illinois athletics teams, according to their official website. The team is based in Champaign, Illinois, where it regularly holds home competitions.",
